<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medtronic downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medtronic downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it downgraded Medtronic Inc to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- With the stock trading near its all-time high and with the rate of revenue and earnings growth declining, NatWest does not expect the shares to outperform the market over the next 12 months, the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/2 to 69-3/4.</p>
</text>
